      "created_at": "2014-12-03T16:54:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Couple of days ago was playing against advance Blade and he got an amazing draw. We didn’t really have any chance to take him out on the front before the dreaded 15. However, environment played Obsidian Field which boosted the two Clever Girls just enough to flip him. When he was low on the flip side, I had to let the Girls finish him again. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
